    <p class="small home-plans-footnote">Enterprise plans are agreed with the ODI. <a href="https://theodi.org/about-the-odi/contact-us/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact the ODI</a> about organisation subscriptions.</p>

    <p><b>Once you login there are two routes through the tool:</b></p>
    <div class="grid-two-by-two">
        <div>
            <h3>Select from example case studies:</h3>
            <p> Learn how to conduct a consequence scan by working through one of our example case studies and identify consequences, determine risks and plan actions.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <h3>Start a new project:</h3>
            <p>Follow the steps in the interactive tool to carry out a review of your own project and generate  a project overview and accompanying risk register.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

  <h2>Supported by AI</h2>
  <p>AI features use a compatible model via CARE&rsquo;s integration (see <a href="/about#useOfAI">your privacy</a> for the current provider). <b>AI is available once you have ODI membership or an active organisation subscription</b> — it is not enabled on a free account alone.</p>
  <p>Where you have access, the AI can help you:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><b>Carry out an automated risk assessment:</b> Provide a detailed description of your project as well as data used and let the AI do a first draft for you of everything from consequenes to actions, giving you a risk regisiter in less that 10 minutes.</li>
        <li><b>Suggest consequences:</b> Both positive and negative, that might arise from your data project, which you can selectively add to your evaluation.</li>
        <li><b>Assess risk:</b> The tool will assess the impact and likelihood of these consequences to help you prioritise and manage risks effectively.</li>
        <li><b>Create actions:</b> The AI will generate specific actions to mitigate and manage identified consequences.</li>
        <li><b>Recommend KPIs: </b>&nbsp;The tool will also recommend key performance indicators (KPIs) for your actions in order to track the effectiveness of your risk mitigation actions.</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- add disclaimer -->
    <p>Please note: Suggestions from the AI assistant are provided for consideration and should be evaluated carefully before the outputs are finalised.</p>
      <% if (user && user.id) { %>
        <!-- Show the "Begin" button if user is logged in -->
        <button class="transparent" onclick="window.location.href='/evaluations'">Begin</button>
    <% } else { %>
        <!-- Show the login button if user is not logged in -->
        <button class="transparent" onclick="window.location.href='/auth/django'">Login</button>
    <% } %>
</section>

<style>
    .grid-two-by-two {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      grid-gap: 1rem;
    }
    .visually-hidden {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      padding: 0;
      margin: -1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
      border: 0;
    }
    .home-plans-intro {
      max-width: 52rem;
    }
    .home-plans-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    }
    .home-plans-table {
      --home-plans-blue: var(--color-dark-blue, #072589);
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 44rem;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      border: 2px solid var(--home-plans-blue);
    }
    .home-plans-table__head-row th {
      background: var(--home-plans-blue);
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid var(--home-plans-blue);
      padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: bottom;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .home-plans-table__corner {
      width: 11rem;
    }
    .home-plans-table__plan {
      min-width: 9.5rem;
    }
    .home-plans-table__plan-title {
      display: block;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .home-plans-table__plan-sub {
      display: block;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      opacity: 0.92;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
      line-height: 1.35;
    }
    .home-plans-table tbody th,
    .home-plans-table tbody td {
      border: 1px solid var(--home-plans-blue);
      padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
      color: var(--color-dark-blue, #072589);
    }
    .home-plans-table__section-row th.home-plans-table__section-title {
      background: rgba(7, 37, 137, 0.1);
      color: var(--color-dark-blue, #072589);
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      padding: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--home-plans-blue);
    }
    .home-plans-table tbody th[scope="row"] {
      font-weight: 600;
      max-width: 14rem;
      color: var(--color-dark-grey, #333);
    }
    .home-plans-table tbody td {
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .home-plans-yes {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--color-dark-blue, #072589);
    }
    .home-plans-footnote {
      max-width: 52rem;
      margin-top: 0.75rem;
    }
    @media (max-width: 40rem) {
      .home-plans-table {
        font-size: 0.85rem;
      }
    }
</style>
